Subject: Input: Goodix GT9886 touchscreen

Combined diff of the following commits (base v7.3-rc7):

  - Input: add Goodix GT9886 touchscreen driver
  - Input: goodix_gt9886: ack every frame
  - Input: goodix_gt9886: drop contacts outside the panel
  - Input: aw8697 - add Awinic AW8697 haptic driver

